## Worksheet

**F1 – Core loop**: `GameState` holds all state; `mulberry32(seed)` feeds `this.rng` used in map/colonist/event generation; `processTurn()` calls systems in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 – Map**: 8x8 loop in `generateMap()` using seeded rng; `canBuildAt()` checks `reqTerrains.includes(tile.terrain)`; `getAdjacencyBonus()` feeds `outMult` in `processProduction()`. Score 2.

**F3 – Economy**: reactor power → condenser water → greenhouse food chain via `prod.cost`; caps in `resourceCaps`; overflow trimmed and logged in `processProduction()`. Score 2.

**F4 – Population**: colonist records with `skill, skillLevel, fatigue, morale`; `buildingAssignments` sets job; `skillMult`/`moraleFactor`/fatigue read in `processProduction()`. Score 2.

**F5 – Needs**: `consumeNeeds()` sets `foodConsumed/waterConsumed`; `updateMorale()` applies -15 penalties; morale feeds `moraleFactor`; recovery via `+5` when morale>80. Score 2.

**F6 – Research**: 8 nodes in `initResearch`; prereq check in `completeResearch`; but `smelting`, `mining-tools`, `hydroponics` have zero effect code anywhere (only 5/8 do anything). Score 1.

**F7 – Events**: only 4 events in `processEvents` array (needs 10+); no player choices anywhere, no cooldown logic. Score 1.

**F8 – Trade**: `tradeWith()` buy/sell both work, caravan qty limited; but `globalSupplyDrift = {}` never gets keys anywhere, so the price-drift loop in `generateCaravanInventory` never executes — prices are effectively static. Score 1.

**F9 – Hazard**: `processAshstorms()` fires periodically and damages `building.health`, but `lastAshstorm` is set *before* severity is computed so severity is always 1 (never grows); `building.health` is never read in `processProduction` (no output loss); no repair function exists anywhere. Score 1.

**F10 – Save/load**: `serialize()` → textarea in `saveGame()`; `GameState.deserialize()` called from `loadFromText()`, wraps `JSON.parse` in try/catch, alerts `'Invalid: ' + e.message`. Score 2.

**F11 – End conditions**: `checkGameOver()` checks both lose (`colonists.length===0`) and win (turn/pop/food/water thresholds); `calculateScore()` combines multiple state values; `showGameOverModal()` renders distinct WIN/LOSE screens. Score 2.

**F12 – UI**: `renderTabs()` tab switching; log entries show `entry.turn`; `.tooltip-text` shows terrain/health/adjacency; `attachKeyboardShortcuts()` (Space, 1-6); `@media (max-width:600px)` layout. Score 2.

**F13 – Dev panel**: `runTests()` checks 11 real invariants (caps, prereqs, stat ranges, save/load roundtrip, map size); `runBenchmark()` runs 200 headless turns via direct `processTurn()` calls and prints `stateHash()`. Score 2.

**G1**: `completeResearch()` only changes `resourceCaps` or does a one-time `resources.power += 100` for fusion-core; `processProduction()` never reads `this.research` at all. Hardcoded special case, not a formula link. Score 2.

**G2**: `consumeNeeds` sets `foodConsumed=false` → `updateMorale` -15 → `colonist.morale` → `moraleFactor` in `processProduction` scales output every turn, visible in People tab. Score 4.

**G3**: `processAshstorms` sets `buildings[key].health -= damage`, but `processProduction` never reads `.health`, and no repair function exists anywhere in the file — output loss and recovery links are entirely absent. Score 1.

**G4**: `tradePrices` only updated inside `for (const res in this.globalSupplyDrift)` in `generateCaravanInventory`, but `globalSupplyDrift` is initialized `{}` and never gets keys added anywhere — loop body never runs, prices never respond to stockpile or drift. Score 0.

**G5**: `processEvents()` events have no choice branches at all (`.choice-buttons` CSS class defined but never referenced in JS); impacts fire automatically with no player decision. Score 0.

